lling food in a lush waterfall world' width='360' height='600' decoding='async'><figcaption>Arcade</figcaption></figure><figure class='app-product-stage-card app-product-stage-card--puzzle'><img src='/assets/images/app/puzzle-real-gameplay.webp' alt='Real TOADAL FEAST Puzzle gameplay from First Feast' width='640' height='360' decoding='async'><figcaption>Puzzle</figcaption></figure><figure class='app-product-stage-card app-product-stage-card--feastfall'><img src='/assets/images/app/feastfall-real-gameplay.webp' alt='Real TOADAL FEAST Feastfall gameplay with the Froggy visitor and food grid' width='640' height='360' decoding='async'><figcaption>Feastfall</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class='app-gameplay-section' aria-labelledby='app-gameplay-heading'><div class='app-gameplay-heading'><p class='section-kicker'>CAPTURED FROM THE GAME</p><h2 id='app-gameplay-heading'>Three ways the Feast plays</h2><p>These images come from real runnable TOADAL FEAST modes. They are presented as mobile-game imagery, not as separate browser games.</p></div><div class='app-gameplay-grid'><article class='app-gameplay-card app-gameplay-card--arcade'><div class='app-gameplay-card-art'><img src='/assets/images/app/arcade-real-gameplay.webp' alt='' width='360' height='600' loading='lazy' decoding='async'></div><div><span class='status-chip'>REAL GAMEPLAY</span><h3>Arcade</h3><p>Catch falling food, protect your lives, and keep the feast going.</p></div></article><article class='app-gameplay-card'><div class='app-gameplay-card-art'><img src='/assets/images/app/puzzle-real-gameplay.webp' alt='' width='640' height='360' loading='lazy' decoding='async'></div><div><span class='status-chip'>REAL GAMEPLAY</span><h3>Puzzle</h3><p>First Feast turns movement, energy, hearts, and food placement into a tactical challenge.</p></div></article><article class='app-gameplay-card'><div class='app-gameplay-card-art'><img src='/assets/images/app/feastfall-real-gameplay.webp' alt='' width='640' heigh